# spiderlint findings for ORIGIN

# Summary

- Rating: B (seo, links)
- Pages: 16
- Findings: 99 (6 error, 54 warning, 39 info, 0 hint)
- Checks passed: 502 of 562; 32 rules failed nowhere.

## links/internal/unreachable (error 7.4)

the page answers 404

Where: /missing, used by or shared with:
- /
- /about
- /app/
- /orphan
- /posts/1
- /posts/2
- /posts/3
- /posts/4
- /posts/5
- /tags/a
- /tags/b
- /tags/c
Reads: `http.status`, `crawl.referrers`
Fix: Fix the page at the link target so it answers 2xx, or point the links to a working URL.
Docs: https://developers.google.com/search/docs/crawling-indexing/http-network-errors
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules links/internal/unreachable` reports no links/internal/unreachable finding.

## html/h1/missing (error 7.4)

no <h1>

Where: 5 pages of group posts (100 %), for example:
- /posts/1: none
- /posts/2: none
- /posts/3: none
Reads: `html.h1`, expects `{"type":"array","minItems":1}`
Fix: Use exactly one <h1> per page.
Docs: https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/Heading_Elements
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/h1/missing` reports no html/h1/missing finding.

## html/viewport/missing (warning 5.3)

no meta viewport

Where: 13 pages in groups posts, default (100 %), for example:
- /: none
- /about: none
- /app/: none
Reads: `html.meta.viewport`, expects `{"type":"string"}`
Fix: Add <meta name=viewport content="width=device-width"> to the head.
Docs: https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/HTML/Viewport_meta_tag
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/viewport/missing` reports no html/viewport/missing finding.

## html/author/missing (warning 3.7)

an article names no author for its link preview

Where: 6 pages of group default (100 %), for example:
- /about: none
- /duplicate: none
- /orphan: none
Reads: `html.author`, expects `{"type":"string","minLength":1}`
Fix: Add <meta name=author>, article:author, or a JSON-LD author to the article head.
Docs: https://github.com/mastodon/mastodon/blob/423d0ca875fccbcd02ed4201999cec1625dee9e6/app/lib/link_details_extractor.rb#L195-L197
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/author/missing` reports no html/author/missing finding.

## html/published-date/missing (warning 3.6)

