## html/title/redundant (warning 4.8)

<title> repeats itself around a separator

Where: /duplicate: 47 characters: “Duplicate Fixture Page - Duplicate Fixture Page”
Reads: `html.title`, expects `{"type":"string","pattern":"^(?!.*(.{2,120}?)\\s*[-|:–—·»]\\s*\\1$).*$"}`
Fix: Remove the repeated suffix from <title>.
Docs: https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/title-link
Done when: `spiderlint audit ORIGIN/ --rules html/title/redundant` reports no html/title/redundant finding, and `spiderlint show-facts ORIGIN/duplicate` shows `html.title` meeting it.

